-- Permission seed for the WP-04 resources.
--
-- Every permission is an EXPLICIT `resource[.subresource]:action[:scope]` triple.
-- No `*` action is introduced: `permissionMatches` treats `*` as matching any
-- action, so a single wildcard would silently grant every action added by a
-- later work package. Migrations 0009 and 0010 removed the last wildcard for
-- exactly that reason, and re-adding one here would undo that work.
--
-- Scope choices follow `policy-matrix.md`:
--   `own`          the authenticated profile is the subject of the row;
--   `assigned`     an active, time-valid care assignment exists;
--   `organization` an active organization membership plus matching row ownership;
--   `global`       seeded platform administration only;
